# Nolan, Cosmic Wayfinder

> Nolan is the assassin whose damage does not exist until two of his rifts touch. Pick him when your draft has peel for a short setup window and a squishy backline you can actually reach. Pick anything else when the enemy already locked Phoveus, Khufra, or Franco.

