## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.95 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Jungle Rift Burst (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Blade of the Heptaseas, Hunter Strike, Malefic Roar, Blade of Despair, Immortality
- Core: Blade of the Heptaseas, Hunter Strike, Malefic Roar
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy has low chain control and shorter rift cycles matter more than tenacity.; Sky Piercer over Blade of Despair when Use only when Nolan is already converting early picks and can protect execute stacks through the next objective fight.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against magic burst when a shield and movement burst save the first dive better than a delayed revive.
- Total cost: 11850 gold

Default jungle setup for priming Cosmic Leap with Heptaseas, detonating the first rift pair, then using Hunter Strike and Ice Retribution to keep the target inside follow-up range.

### Snowball Execute (Jungle)

- Items: Magic Boots, Blade of the Heptaseas, Sky Piercer, Hunter Strike, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar
- Core: Blade of the Heptaseas, Sky Piercer, Hunter Strike
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Flame Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Magic Boots when Use when one stun or slow chain is the main reason Nolan loses his Sky Piercer stacks.; Immortality over Blade of Despair when Use once shutdown risk is higher than the value of the last raw damage slot.; Sea Halberd over Blade of Despair when Use when healing, shields, or high-extra-HP fighters keep targets above the execute threshold.
- Total cost: 11240 gold

High-risk snowball setup for games where Nolan gets early kills, turns those kills into Sky Piercer pressure, and uses Flame Retribution as one more burst check.

### Anti-Sustain Armor (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Blade of the Heptaseas, Hunter Strike, Sea Halberd, Malefic Roar, Rose Gold Meteor
- Core: Blade of the Heptaseas, Hunter Strike, Sea Halberd
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, War Cry
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Blade of Despair over Rose Gold Meteor when Use when enemy sustain is handled and Nolan can turn the last slot back into raw execution damage.; Immortality over Rose Gold Meteor when Use before final Lord fights when one revive is more valuable than a magic-burst shield.; Athena's Shield over Rose Gold Meteor when Use against front-loaded magic burst that kills Nolan before Lifeline can convert into a clean disengage.
- Total cost: 10590 gold

Anti-sustain jungle setup for games where the first pick is still the goal, but Sea Halberd and Malefic Roar are needed before the enemy frontline collapses.

